# Optional overrides for corpus messages that must return a parse Err, but where
# the harness cannot prove malformation automatically.
#
# Format (TAB-separated):
#   relative/path/from/corpus-root.eml<TAB>expected-error-substring
#
# Unclosed multipart (missing an exact `--boundary--` line) is detected
# automatically and does not need an entry here.
#
# Example:
# corpus/edge-cases/malformed/foo.eml	Illegal field-name
